<title>UK: Glencore plans to up Asturiana Zinc stake.</title>
<headline>Glencore plans to up Asturiana Zinc stake.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Glencore said on Tuesday it had filed a proposal with the Spanish securities commission, Comission Nacional del Mercado de Valores (CNMV), to increase its ownership interest in Asturiana de Zinc S.A.</p>
<p>&quot;Glencore currently holds a 24.79 percent stake in the company and has proposed that it acquire an additional 20 percent through a Public Tender Offer at a price per share of 3,400 ptas, a premium of 25 percent over the average closing price of the last 30 days,&quot; Glencore said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said a response by the CNMV to Glencore's proposal was expected shortly.</p>
